<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has intensified cross-border strikes, hitting a Hezbollah weapons shipment in the eastern Beqaa Valley, demolishing a Hezbollah tunnel in southern Lebanon, and flying a low-altitude drone over homes in the south. US envoy Waltz visited Beirut demanding Hezbollah disarmament and condemning recent attacks. Iraq deployed its army to a stronghold of Iran-backed Kataib Hezbollah, linking the broader regional fight to the Israel-Hezbollah clash. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOa3NHNHRRVEVtSjFqc3lmMWVtWnZpX0loMlBTY0dQQnh0LUZXamxSNGE5Nzl3Mm82ZGpxN0QtejhGOHhaVFJncTJOeHJYVHN1dExWQ0laUVBqXzFBUnZHZi1zS3Jfa1ZPcm9zSDlMNGFybGItNHlkcDBncDB6YUNjN3lvRVhlcGp1OVF4TkRxRzlvbHVxZ21PV29Ma1ltY05pNlBqcWoyV25HY2xXWHFMS1I4UF9zanFu0gG-AUFVX3lxTE0tNjJLZTRNUXd4ai1xVzgzemFVYUltUDA5X29JVVo2YlVkczNfN0dKOGRNNWMxSFc5WmQ4LVJvRUVmbllmSkNjTmxueENxd3dqVUZlNnRLaVlMeE1oSkFaLWxJTWFGYWFQaHZzWlJiMGlnUVF4MkNkSHBqakhRQ3oyUWlBZHFvWFBHeGdHMjRQU1JwQU8yZ0prZDVvM0JRcVlQZ19LaUhMVk1SRVBfSXN4ZU1sal9QMlE4RnZnaVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE50VGFwV05SZFlob1RXRWk4U0hnRkhYd1VwazNTWlZZTVVyTTAtdlp5bm5jeDdqRC1POGxsUDNDNW1vZDRrNHV4Nm90c2lta0dIR01UQkwwcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9HYS1ZOVVsQVJLeTRWMmY3WjJHZXZsMnFIZ1VvRkVLUkNVaU9qQ3NucVpqbGJuRkp2cXBPMDZJMFMzb0ltNUo5RVY4dDZfYjlJYWFuM1ZlTVJCd3htM24zc1RBY003NXRYZzBmTnNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https:/